  "description": "Bring a relaxed and refreshing feel to your designs with this chocomint horizontal stripe seamless pattern. Featuring alternating bands of chocolate brown, mint green, and complementary shades such as polar green, green tint, dark leather, and Havana, this repeating design blends rich warmth with a cool, minty aesthetic. The simple horizontal layout works beautifully for both playful and sophisticated projects, making it a versatile addition to your digital paper and surface pattern collections.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n– Scrapbooking, journaling, and planner decorations\n– Digital paper collections and printable backgrounds\n– Packaging, labels, and chocolate or mint-themed branding\n– Fabric prints, textiles, and stationery\n– Invitations, greeting cards, and gift wrapping\n– Cute, cozy, and food-inspired design projects\n– Spring crafts and year-round creative projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a relaxed and refreshing feel to your designs with this chocomint horizontal stripe seamless pattern. Featuring alternating bands of chocolate brown, mint green, and complementary shades such as polar green, green tint, dark leather, and Havana, this repeating design blends rich warmth with a cool, minty aesthetic. The simple horizontal layout works beautifully for both playful and sophisticated projects, making it a versatile addition to your digital paper and surface pattern collections.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n•15 seamless patterns<br>\n•Format: JPEG<br>\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n•High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n– Scrapbooking, journaling, and planner decorations<br>\n– Digital paper collections and printable backgrounds<br>\n– Packaging, labels, and chocolate or mint-themed branding<br>\n– Fabric prints, textiles, and stationery<br>\n– Invitations, greeting cards, and gift wrapping<br>\n– Cute, cozy, and food-inspired design projects<br>\n– Spring crafts and year-round creative projects</p>",
